OL,3,AAlaska Senate candidate denies knowing
OL,4,Aabout alleged plot to put two Dan
OL,5,ASullivans on ballot
OL,6,
OL,7,FDemocratic Senate candidate Mary
OL,8,FPeltola has denied she knew anything
OL,9,Fabout an alleged "scheme" that led to
OL,10,Ftwo men named Dan Sullivan standing in
OL,11,Fthe Alaska Senate race.
OL,13,FThe denial comes as the Trump
OL,14,Fadministration continues to escalate a
OL,15,Fcriminal investigation into the matter,
OL,16,Fincluding a request for election
OL,17,Fofficials to separate ballots that rank
OL,18,Fretired teacher Dan J Sullivan.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
