OL,3,AAlaska Senate candidate denies knowing
OL,4,Aabout alleged plot to put two Dan
OL,5,ASullivans on ballot
OL,6,
OL,7,FSenator Dan S Sullivan, the incumbent
OL,8,FRepublican running for re-election, and
OL,9,Fallies have accused the Democrats of
OL,10,Ftrying to confuse voters.
OL,12,FThe Alaska race is considered by
OL,13,Fanalysts to be one of the tightest in
OL,14,Fthe upcoming US midterm elections,
OL,15,Fwhich will decide which party controls
OL,16,FCongress.
